{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103600","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103600","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1810360001:1":{"text":"레인! 어떻게 된 게냐!","source_cn":"里纳！快让老身看看你的情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E4D329E26532BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1810360002:1":{"text":"할멈, 저는 괜찮아요.","source_cn":"婆婆，我还好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x159BA872756C300F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810360003:1":{"text":"근데 제가 왜 붉은 촛불꽃에 감염된 걸까요? 설마 저... 그레이브본 아니었어요?","source_cn":"我为什么会被赤烛蕊感染？难道我……我不是亡灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE8FF26C0E68E6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810360004:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810360005:1":{"text":"할멈, 저는 대체 누구인 거죠?","source_cn":"婆婆，我到底是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x394D6A86C2C89F01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1810360005":{"text":"할멈, 저는 대체 누구인 거죠?","sourc